        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "{\n  \"analysis\": \"We have inspected the input files. DHFR is in plasmid.gb, and Biopython is not installed. The 20 PDB IDs and antibody sequences are available but not yet annotated. We need identify the PDB proteins, find donor/acceptor fluorescent proteins matching 505 nm excitation and 610 nm emission via FPbase, identify the molecule-binding protein for the given SMILES, identify the antibody target, then assemble and validate the gBlock.\",\n  \"plan\": \"Query RCSB FASTA/metadata for all PDB IDs to get exact sequences and titles, and query FPbase API endpoints to discover available data formats. This will determine which proteins to use for donor, acceptor, and molecule binder.\",\n  \"commands\": [\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport urllib.request, urllib.parse, json, sys\\nids=[x.strip().upper() for x in open('/app/pdb_ids.txt') if x.strip()]\\nprint('ids', ids, flush=True)\\nfor pid in ids:\\n    print('\\\\n###', pid, flush=True)\\n    for url in [f'https://www.rcsb.org/fasta/entry/{pid}', f'https://data.rcsb.org/rest/v1/core/entry/{pid}']:\\n        try:\\n            req=urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'User-Agent':'Mozilla/5.0'})\\n            data=urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=12).read().decode('utf-8','replace')\\n            if 'fasta' in url:\\n                print(data[:1200].replace('\\\\n','\\\\\\\\n'), flush=True)\\n            else:\\n                j=json.loads(data)\\n                print((url, j.get('struct',{}).get('title'), j.get('struct_keywords',{}).get('text')), flush=True)\\n        except Exception as e:\\n            print('ERR', url, repr(e), flush=True)\\nPY\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 5.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport urllib.request, urllib.parse, json, sys\\nbase='https://www.fpbase.org/api/'\\nfor path in ['proteins/?format=json', 'proteins/', 'spectra/?format=json', 'spectrums/?format=json']:\\n    url=base+path\\n    try:\\n        req=urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'User-Agent':'Mozilla/5.0'})\\n        data=urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=20).read().decode('utf-8','replace')\\n        print('\\\\n###', url, 'len', len(data), flush=True)\\n        print(data[:1500], flush=True)\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        print('ERR', url, repr(e), flush=True)\\nPY\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 5.0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"task_complete\": false\n}",
